WEBVTT

1
00:00:22.078 --> 00:00:29.078
<u><font color=#80FF00>Subtitle By: <b><font color=#FF8040>MARSH-MARIE</font></b></font></u>

2
00:00:29.278 --> 00:00:31.417
<font color=#0080C0>There's just something
about the sunny blue sky</font>

3
00:00:31.417 --> 00:00:34.023
<font color=#0080C0>in this town that makes them shine.</font>

4
00:00:34.023 --> 00:00:37.023
<font color=#0080C0>The power, the draw, the expression.</font>

5
00:00:38.332 --> 00:00:40.172
<font color=#0080C0>The enchantment of a woman's hands</font>

6
00:00:40.172 --> 00:00:42.561
<font color=#0080C0>when they are well taken care of.</font>

7
00:00:42.561 --> 00:00:44.972
<font color=#0080C0>It really is hard to resist</font>

8
00:00:44.972 --> 00:00:49.713
<font color=#0080C0>the way nails feel when gently
grazed against your skin.</font>

9
00:00:49.713 --> 00:00:51.993
<font color=#0080C0>The way a perfectly primp set of toes</font>

10
00:00:51.993 --> 00:00:54.772
<font color=#0080C0>looks in the right pair of heels.</font>

11
00:00:54.772 --> 00:00:56.522
<font color=#0080C0>I've always loved it.</font>

12
00:00:57.503 --> 00:01:00.281
<font color=#0080C0>I had a teacher in school
who always tapped her nails</font>

13
00:01:00.281 --> 00:01:03.543
<font color=#0080C0>on things when she was
trying to make a point.</font>

14
00:01:03.543 --> 00:01:06.503
<font color=#0080C0>I would watch her run her
long acrylic french tips</font>

15
00:01:06.503 --> 00:01:10.513
<font color=#0080C0>through her hair as she put it in a bun.</font>

16
00:01:10.513 --> 00:01:12.930
<font color=#0080C0>Some might say I had a crush on her,</font>

17
00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:17.180
<font color=#0080C0>but really I was completely
entranced by her hands.</font>

18
00:01:18.433 --> 00:01:21.143
<font color=#0080C0>It was as if she was
conducting a symphony,</font>

19
00:01:21.143 --> 00:01:23.823
<font color=#0080C0>and her fingers played
the role of the baton.</font>

20
00:01:23.823 --> 00:01:25.732
<font color=#0080C0>I would eagerly await the holidays,</font>

21
00:01:25.732 --> 00:01:28.088
<font color=#0080C0>because she would switch to a deep red</font>

22
00:01:28.088 --> 00:01:29.264
<font color=#0080C0>that looked like fresh blood,</font>

23
00:01:29.264 --> 00:01:31.944
<font color=#0080C0>perfectly painted on her fingertips.</font>

24
00:01:31.944 --> 00:01:36.944
<font color=#0080C0>No doubt, my passion for nail
care began during that time.</font>

25
00:01:37.024 --> 00:01:40.003
<font color=#0080C0>I knew the possibilities
were endless then,</font>

26
00:01:40.003 --> 00:01:44.170
<font color=#0080C0>and the nail world still
